{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:5.135.060","page_type":"section"},"citation":"5.135.060","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.135.060","content_hash":"3e4e817def1e0c0df7fbc6837e7abdeadf544ca58a449554a9e6c1f7984e0b4c","heading":"General operating requirements.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.135.060","text":"The following general operating requirements shall apply to all salvage yards:\n(a) The permit issued pursuant to this chapter shall be plainly displayed on the business premises.\n(b) The salvage yard, together with things kept therein, shall at all times be maintained in a sanitary condition.\n(c) No space not covered by the permit shall be used in the permitted business.\n(d) No water shall be allowed to stand in any place on the premises in such manner as to afford a breeding place for mosquitoes.\n(e) Weeds and vegetation on the premises, other than trees, shall be kept at a height of not more than 12 inches.\n(f) No garbage or waste liable to give off a foul odor or attract vermin shall be kept on the premises; nor shall any refuse of any kind be kept on the premises, unless such refuse is junk and is used in the permitted salvage business.\n(g) Junk shall be stored in piles not exceeding 10 feet in height and shall be arranged so as to permit easy access to all such junk for firefighting purposes.\n(h) No combustible material of any kind not necessary or beneficial to the permitted business shall be kept on the premises; nor shall the premises be allowed to become a fire hazard.\n(i) Gasoline and oil shall be removed from any dismantled or scrapped engines or vehicles on the premises.\n(j) No junk or other material shall be burned on the premises except in accordance with Kansas Administrative Regulations 28-19-40 through 28-19-43 , as amended. (Code 1981 § 38-101.1. Code 1995 § 114-155.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"5c9d357f-a5d0-5970-9f1f-2d4823e41fb0"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.135.060","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.135.060","content_hash":"0aa5b539ce156a8e50b3a28b87d6a4dc223b9d3dc05c07626e2fb08710a939e5","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.135.060","text":"The following general operating requirements shall apply to all salvage yards:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"70dd1755-7016-5660-a205-31ee1d7ca9cb"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.135.060","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.135.060","content_hash":"676e7a59b72da4e9666e35cdf7d60e9978525f02c926134f3c99fe810bba02c3","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:block:1","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.135.060","text":"(a) The permit issued pursuant to this chapter shall be plainly displayed on the business premises.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"0cb4f219-8540-57d4-9fe7-aba593cd108e"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.135.060","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.135.060","content_hash":"c27201d761ba721ac47486d869283660fd5a677dc9407f50d33528966a7c0574","heading":null,"ordinal":2,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:block:2","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.135.060","text":"(b) The salvage yard, together with things kept therein, shall at all times be maintained in a sanitary condition.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"52910461-fae3-57a9-94d6-360c8923df4e"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.135.060","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.135.060","content_hash":"2d501c5999d72cfde9a2ac7e24cfd4c57d8ffd683415c5d1f92aafc7340d2a75","heading":null,"ordinal":3,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:block:3","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.135.060","text":"(c) No space not covered by the permit shall be used in the permitted business.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"fa215952-aeb7-5500-bc4c-5377c89adf47"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.135.060","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.135.060","content_hash":"08c9ee8123be718318f1a0cd82cc704eeb73d3f8d3094aba05a569713ed77fda","heading":null,"ordinal":4,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:block:4","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.135.060","text":"(d) No water shall be allowed to stand in any place on the premises in such manner as to afford a breeding place for mosquitoes.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"1a27180e-67a6-5df2-8705-c8ef0d45fbf2"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.135.060","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.135.060","content_hash":"86f524809aa7e3c7a84d4329b3d6dd1d9b5b41adecf03dc7c60f013f5842ec24","heading":null,"ordinal":5,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:m